./AnomaClaw/refine-logs/round-0-initial-proposal.md:16:- **More references (k=2→4→8)**: Our ablation shows k=4 is optimal (AUROC 0.71→0.80), but specificity plateaus. More images help the VLM understand "normal range" but don't fix the reasoning flaw.
