./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:24:### Smoke test (real VLM calls, 24 items, SeedVL)
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:26:- Plan generated by SeedVL planner for D1 industrial: `{strategy: interpret, expert: subspacead, tools: [domain_descriptor, hotspot_cropper, component_counter, knowledge_lookup]}` — sensible.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:34:- **SeedVL** (calibration-router variant): COMPLETED 1416/1418 (2 parse failures). Macro AUROC: **v3=0.785**, fusion=0.796, direct=0.780.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:37:  - Per-domain wins on SeedVL: D6 LEVIR change +13.4 pp over fusion, D5d GI +2.9 pp, D9 logical +4.6 pp
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:40:- **Qwen3.5-VL-27B** (autonomous-planner variant): COMPLETED 1408/1418 (10 parse failures). Macro AUROC: **v3=0.778**, fusion=0.831, direct=0.777.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:41:  - v3 vs fusion: Δ=−5.4 pp (CI [−7.1, −3.7], significant)
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:48:- Main results Table 1 now has an `AnomalyClaw v3 (real, autonomous agent)` row showing SeedVL 0.785 / Qwen3.5 0.763.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:49:- New Finding 5 paragraph in §4.2 reports the honest result: v3 ties fusion on SeedVL, trails on Qwen3.5; per-domain agent wins on semantic / logical domains where the planner correctly avoids fusion.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:57:- `paper/sections/4_experiments.tex` — new Table 1 (direct / fusion / debate / interpret / descriptor router / calibration router / oracle); 4-finding narrative; bootstrap Table 2; honest limitations.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:59:- `paper/sections/A_appendix.tex` — added `app:debate`, `app:router_rules`, `app:tools` sections; updated `app:trace` with two Qwen3.5/SeedVL trace snippets from the actual runs.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:65:- `paper/figures/fig_per_domain.pdf` (per-domain AUROC × strategy with router choice highlighted).
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:74:3. **Router numbers in the paper are still SIMULATED for 2/3 backbones**: the `Descriptor Router` and `Calibration Router` rows in Table 1 are computed by re-using each strategy's existing per-item scores. The Qwen3.5 and SeedVL `AnomalyClaw v3 (real)` rows will be added once the long-running benchmarks complete (next ~1.5–2.5 hours), at which point I'll regenerate Table 1 + bootstrap Table 2 with real numbers.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:79:- `refine-logs/PER_DOMAIN_STRATEGY_MATRIX.md` — full per-domain × strategy AUROC matrix.
./archive/old_docs/SESSION_SUMMARY_20260415.md:81:- `refine-logs/finalize_v3_paper.sh` — run this once both v3 result files complete (or partially complete) to regenerate the macro AUROC table + recompile.
