t/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-AD/pill/test/crack/015.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.1, "rationale": "The query image matches the reference profile of a white oval pill with 'FF' imprint and red speckles. The observed texture variations fall within the allowed range, indicating no anomaly.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D1_0084", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-AD/tile/test/good/002.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the texture and surface characteristics of the query image match the normal reference images, with no unique anomalies detected.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D1_0001", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-AD/pill/test/good/016.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The query image matches the normal reference profile: a white oval pill with 'FF' imprint and red specks. All observed features fall within the allowed variations (minor texture, lighting), and no defects were found.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D1_0015", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-AD/zipper/test/good/003.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The only potential anomaly identified (a small bright spot) was confirmed to be present in the reference images, indicating it is a normal variation. No other defects were observed.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D1_0073", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-AD/hazelnut/test/good/019.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The query image shows a hazelnut with a cap and shell texture that are consistent with the natural variations observed in the provided reference images. No anomalous features were detected.", "error": null}], "passive": [{"item_id": "D1_0085", "score": 0.15, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D1", "rationale": "The query image displays a uniform brown leather-like texture that is consistent with the patterns and color variations seen in all four refer