surface and lighting, are consistent with the normal variations observed in the reference images. No anomalous features were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0000", "score": 0.08, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The potential anomaly of unusual lighting was refuted as similar patterns exist in the normal reference images. No other defects were observed.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0002", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a standard roadway traffic scene during the day, which aligns with the reference profile's object definition and allowed variations (lighting, vehicle density). No anomalous features were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0006", "score": 0.15, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a standard night-time driving scene in an urban environment, consistent with the variety of normal driving conditions shown in the reference images (including other night scenes). No specific defects, unusual objects, or anomalous events are observed.", "n_turns": 1, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0084", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a daytime urban traffic scene. The reference profiler confirms that variations in lighting (day vs. night) and setting (urban vs. highway) are allowed normal variations. Since the query fits these criteria, it is not anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0072", "score": 0.1, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the features in the query image, specifically the road reflections, are consistent with normal variations seen in the reference images, particularly the other nighttime scene. No anomalous defects were identified.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0063", "score": 0.1, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a nighttime driving scene. The reference profiler confirms that 'time of day' and 'lighting shift' are allowed variations within the normal distribution of driving scenes. The content (road, vehicles, traffic signals) is consistent with the expected object and shape. Thus, the image is not anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0076", "score": 0.9, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, obstructive blue and black object in the top-right corner that is not present in any of the reference images, indicating an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0019", "score": 0.1, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image shows a daytime scene, while references are night/dusk. The side-by-side check confirmed that structural features (dashboard, road markings) are consistent across images, and the lighting difference is a natural variation, not an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0074", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a daytime highway scene with a scrapyard, which fundamentally contradicts the reference baseline of nighttime urban street views. This represents a severe domain shift in time, location, and content, confirming the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0143", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a reindeer on the road, a feature not present in any of the reference images, indicating a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0124", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a row of electric scooters, a distinct object class not present in any of the reference images, confirming the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0128", "score": 0.95, "labe