ionale": "The query image depicts a night street scene which is consistent with one of the provided reference images. No unique or anomalous features were found that are not present in the normal reference set.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0105", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a giraffe on the road, a feature completely absent from all reference images depicting normal driving conditions, confirming a high anomaly score.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0115", "score": 0.98, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains elephants and a cart, which are fundamentally different from the 'urban street view with cars' defined in the reference profile. This feature is not an allowed variation, confirming the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0155", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a wild boar on the road, which is not present in any of the reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0119", "score": 0.98, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a donkey carrying hay on a dirt road, which is a significant deviation from the reference images showing cars on paved roads. The anomaly is confirmed as the feature is not found in any reference.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0148", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image contains a deer crossing the road, a feature completely absent from the reference images which depict standard traffic scenarios. This confirms the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0161", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "rationale": "The query image depicts a tractor in a village, which fundamentally differs from the reference images' object class (