./archive/paper-backup-20260406-165239/sections/0_abstract.tex:5:Matched ablations confirm that expert-as-context outperforms expert-as-router (+3.3 AUROC points) and score-fusion (+3.0 points) integration strategies, with the largest benefits appearing on local-appearance and logical anomaly domains.
./archive/paper-backup-20260406-165239/sections/0_abstract.tex:6:With calibration-tuned family-adaptive fusion, AnomaClaw achieves 0.882 macro-averaged AUROC (95\% CI: 0.824--0.937), improving over a pure VLM baseline (0.866) and a multi-round agent baseline (0.873).
