./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:732:- **Evidence**: GPT-5.4 v0 test AUROC improves from 0.754 (generic descriptors) to 0.825 (task-anchored descriptors), a +7.1pp gain across 11 domains.
./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:735:- **This finding is backbone-independent**: all three VLMs (GPT-5.4, SeedVL, Qwen3.5) benefit.
./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:738:- **SeedVL**: agent test macro 0.818 vs v0 0.789 = **+2.9pp**, 9/11 domains improved.
./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:743:- **SubspaceAD** (DINOv2-giant + PCA, training-free) reaches 1.000 AUROC on D11 VisA calibration where best VLM is 0.85.
./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:751:- v3 Debate: -5.6pp on SeedVL (refuter rationalises correct predictions).
./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:765:| Method | GPT-5.4 | SeedVL | Qwen3.5 |
