./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1480:paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:180:\caption{Per-domain AUROC on the SeedVL test split (v1 AnomalyClaw). Bold = improvement $\geq 2$ pp over v0.}
