./review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1496:paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:256:\caption{Budget-matched negative controls. \emph{v0 Direct, SubspaceAD fusion, and AnomalyClaw rows are on the test split} (same numbers as Table~\ref{tab:main_results}, repeated for comparison). \emph{``Random escalation'' and ``DINOv2 blend'' rows are calibration-split numbers} — these are disqualified designs we ran only on GPT-5.4 and SeedVL calibration, not on the test splits. Random escalation re-prompts a random 30\% of items; DINOv2 blend swaps SubspaceAD for a weaker patch-NN expert.}
