   215	$n{=}500$ images, $2{,}302$ questions). Unified agent v9 vs a matched
   216	Direct VLM baseline with the same MCQ-aware prompt. Ensemble is
   217	reported only for AD (our primary target). For non-AD types the gap
   218	between agent and Direct is small and not in one consistent direction:
   219	the agent helps on descriptive defect reasoning (Description,
   220	Classification) but regresses on object-classification questions where
   221	the Direct prompt is already near-ceiling.}
