review-stage/codex_review_r2_raw.out:68:- **Corrected v8 has not been rerun.** The old v8 test data reflects pre-schema-fix prompts. Rerunning v8 on dev+test is ~3 hours of Qwen3.5 vLLM compute, not done in this round due to budget. The schema fix is correctness (reviewer will see traces) rather than expected to change AUROC materially.
