review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1944:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:5:  - mcq_answer (when options present)
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1945:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:11:  - detection / mcq_binary: v8 refutation protocol unchanged.
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1946:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:12:  - mcq_choice (4-way): observe → list evidence → match options → pick.
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1947:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:15:Every turn returns a JSON object with the fields needed for its mode
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1948:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:23:REFUTATION PROBES (detection / binary-AD mode):
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1949:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:25:  tool_side_by_side(bbox=[x0,y0,x1,y1])
