review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1972:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:99:    refutation_trace.initial_score: gut anomaly score 0..1
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1973:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:100:    refutation_trace.candidate_features: list (0..3) of
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1974:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:102:    refutation_target: index into candidate_features (int|null)
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1975:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:104:    - If candidate_features empty AND initial_score<0.3 →
