review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1980:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:116:  Action: either another refutation call or final.
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1981:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:119:  - All candidates refuted (empty remaining) → 0.05-0.20
