review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1985:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:129:========= Mode 3: mcq_choice (4-way visual Q&A) =========
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1986:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:133:Turn 1 (often final):
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1987:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:135:    mode: "mcq_choice"
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1988:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:141:    mcq_answer: letter with highest option_scores
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1989:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:144:2 options within 0.1 of each other). Preferred tools here:
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1990:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:145:  tool_zoom_bbox, tool_reference_profiler, tool_domain_knowledge.
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1991:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:146:Avoid refutation probes (tool_side_by_side, tool_image_diff) unless
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1992:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:147:the question explicitly asks about a specific region.
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r1_raw.out:1993:benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v9.py:150:observation; finalise.
