review-stage/codex_review_r3_raw.out:1450:refine-logs/CODEX_REVIEW_2026-04-18.md:3776:- [benchmark/scripts/compose_ensemble.py](/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/scripts/compose_ensemble.py:38): ensemble fallback only handles missing scores, not errored records. Agent JSON failures still carry `anomaly_score=0.5`, so `compose_ensemble.py` averages Direct with synthetic 0.5 instead of falling back to Direct. In current Qwen v6.5+D this changes 6 items and slightly changes macro AUROC.
