review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1046:./paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:174:\caption{Per-domain AUROC per strategy (all three backbones). Red $\blacktriangledown$ marks the strategy selected by the calibration router for that (backbone, domain) cell.}
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1047:./paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:180:\caption{Per-domain AUROC on the SeedVL test split (v1 AnomalyClaw). Bold = improvement $\geq 2$ pp over v0.}
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1048:./paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:209:\caption{Leave-one-domain-out macro AUROC gain of score fusion over v0. All 11 LOO splits are positive on every backbone.}
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1056:./paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:330:The descriptor router maps each domain family to a default strategy. Rules were frozen once from the benchmark descriptor before any test query; no calibration AUROC was consulted.
