atomical structures (ventricles, cortical folds) present in all reference images. This absence is not covered by the allowed variations (contrast shift, slice level), indicating a severe anomaly or artifact.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0043", "score": 0.08, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison revealed that the features initially considered anomalous are also present in the normal reference images, indicating no anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0088", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image is a sagittal view of the brain, whereas all provided reference images are axial views. This fundamental difference in anatomical orientation makes the query image anomalous relative to the reference set.", "n_turns": 1, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0030", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image displays normal brain anatomy consistent with the reference images. Observed differences are within the allowed variations (slice level, contrast, rotation) and do not indicate a defect.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0029", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the right hemisphere that is absent in all normal reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0089", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image exhibits significantly enlarged lateral ventricles compared to the normal reference images, indicating a clear structural anomaly (hydrocephalus).", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0025", "score": 0.08, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirms that the features in the query image, specifically the central structures, are consistent with the normal variations observed in the reference images. No anomalous features were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0082", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the right hemisphere that is not present in any of the normal reference images, confirming an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0071", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the right hemisphere that is not present in any of the normal reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0150", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image shows normal brain anatomy consistent with the provided reference images; no anomalous features were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0142", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the right frontal lobe that is not present in any of the normal reference images, confirming a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0112", "score": 0.98, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, bright, irregular mass in the lower-left region that is completely absent in all normal reference images, confirming a severe anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0111", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, bright hyperintense region in the left hemisphere that is completely absent in all normal reference images, confirming it as a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0106", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, focal hyperintense lesion in the right parietal lobe that is completely absent in all provided normal reference images, confirming a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0092", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct, large hyperintense lesion in the lower right region that is absent in all normal reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0139", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, bright abnormality in the lower-left region that is completely absent in all reference images, confirming it as a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0179", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image is a standard axial brain MRI slice that matches the reference images in structure and appearance. No features outside the allowed variations (slice level, contrast, rotation, noise) were observed, indicating a normal scan.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0102", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the central brain region that is completely absent in all provided normal reference images, confirming a clear anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0156", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the left parietal white matter that is not present in any of the normal reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0161", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a large, abnormal hyperintense mass in the left hemisphere that is not present in any of the normal reference images, confirming a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0136", "score": 0.08, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the features in the query image are consistent with the normal variations observed in the reference images, leading to a low anomaly score.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0127", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct, large hyperintense lesion in the white matter that is not present in any of the provided normal reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0168", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct hyperintense lesion in the bottom-right region that is absent in all normal reference images, confirming the presence of an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D9_0118", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D9", "rationale": "The query image exhibits large, bright hyperintense regions in the white matter that are completely absent in all provided normal reference images, confirming a significant anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}]
