 "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b39fe3cd-553d15a3.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.0490763783454895}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b3853f81-272f6c37.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.03583705425262451}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/c0697e71-84867efa.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.022814009338617325}], "rationale": "The query image contains a reindeer standing in the middle of the road, a feature completely absent in the reference images which depict normal traffic scenarios. This confirms the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0074", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b747a85e-9e012bdf.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.20022249221801758}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b39fe3cd-553d15a3.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.18276825547218323}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b6f77fda-46184a8c.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.1325957030057907}], "rationale": "The query image depicts a daytime highway with a large scrap pile, which fundamentally contradicts the reference baseline of nighttime urban street scenes. This deviation is not an allowed variation, confirming a strong anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0072", "score": 0.08, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/c02ee64a-3178b7fa.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.4167197346687317}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/c0a66d6a-607213d1.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.34720659255981445}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b747a85e-9e012bdf.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.34505873918533325}], "rationale": "The query image shows a standard nighttime driving scene. The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the visual features, such as road texture and lighting, are consistent with the provided normal references, specifically the other night scene. No anomalies were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0124", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b81771ca-32f6b949.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.010028807446360588}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b39fe3cd-553d15a3.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.00816916674375534}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b996d83b-2f6ef415.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.0008608251810073853}], "rationale": "The query image shows a static scene of parked scooters in a lot, which contradicts the reference baseline of active roadway driving scenes. This difference in object class and scene context is not an allowed variation, confirming the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0164", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/c0a66d6a-607213d1.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.055397726595401764}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b39fe3cd-553d15a3.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.04531371220946312}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b996d83b-2f6ef415.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.030846431851387024}], "rationale": "The query image contains a small airplane flying low over a road, which is a significant deviation from the normal 'street traffic scene' profile established by the references. This feature is not an allowed variation, confirming the image as anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D12_0142", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D12", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b747a85e-9e012bdf.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.10872196406126022}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b996d83b-2f6ef415.jpg", "l": 0, "s": 0.0981045663356781}, {"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/benchmark/data/BDD100K_normal/data/b81771ca-32f6b949.jpg", "l": ote abstract to lead with score-diverse ensembling (main contribution) + v8 as secondary/interpretable variant.
